        "text": "Operating profit decreased by $46,000 from Q1 to Q2. The accounting bridge attributes this to a $63,000 positive revenue contribution, offset by negative contributions of $83,000 from COGS and $26,000 from operating expenses; therefore, COGS was the largest negative account contribution.",
