          "company-01:2025-Q1→2025-Q2:operating_expenses:profit_contribution"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "COGS increased every month: $45,000 in January, $48,000 in February, $50,000 in March, $65,000 in April, $74,000 in May, and $87,000 in June. The largest month-over-month increase was $15,000 from March to April, followed by increases of $9,000 from April to May and $13,000 from May to June.",
